  "question": {
    "text": "Let<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></math> &nbsp;be an increasing geometric progression of positive real numbers. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>1296</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math>, then, the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
